odecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144130/extras/c488dada58f4ef946f33c9d7c8a0c875.mp4?t=1724158860\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Journey through 30+ floors of hazards and fiendish puzzles.<br></li><li> Collect hidden objects.<br></li><li> Find hidden levels.<br></li><li> Challenge yourself and beat each level's target time.<br></li><li> Full controller support.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144130/extras/776cdd3f76ff127c460c40811a93cb92.poster.avif?t=1724158860\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2144130/extras/776cdd3f76ff127c460c40811a93cb92.apng?t=1724158860\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div>",
